{"phase": "e_mak_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 3, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "mak_zhendong_base.webp", "name": "", "line": "佢直行直過，眼尾都冇掃阿偉一下，好似嗰度冇企住個人咁。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_mak_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 4, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "mak_zhendong_base.webp", "name": "", "line": "夜場收工，獅子山製片嘅走廊得返幾盞燈，麥震東一個人坐喺梯級度。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_mak_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 5, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "mak_zhendong_base.webp", "name": "", "line": "佢拆開紗布，舊患腫到發紫，手指震咗一下。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_mak_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 6, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "mak_zhendong_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "東哥……原來咁嚴重。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_mak_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 7, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "mak_zhendong_base.webp", "name": "麥震東", "line": "細聲啲。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_mak_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 8, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "mak_zhendong_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "你咁樣頂法，隻手會廢㗎。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_mak_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 9, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "mak_zhendong_base.webp", "name": "麥震東", "line": "廢咗，都要開工。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_mak_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 10, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "mak_zhendong_base.webp", "name": "麥震東", "line": "我一停，武師班十幾個人，邊個出糧俾佢哋？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_mak_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 11, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "mak_zhendong_sad.webp", "name": "麥震東", "line": "以前吊威也，冇墊冇網，跌落嚟，爬返起身再嚟。嗰陣邊有人問你痛唔痛。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_mak_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 12, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "mak_zhendong_smile.webp", "name": "麥震東", "line": "捱到今日，唔係我叻，係我唔敢停。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_mak_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 13, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "mak_zhendong_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "東哥……", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_mak_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 14, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "mak_zhendong_base.webp", "name": "", "line": "佢望住阿偉，冇再講嘢，等佢開口。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_mak_heart", "attempt": 0, "step": 15, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "mak_zhendong_base.webp", "name": "麥震東", "line": "……", "choices": ["應承幫佢守秘密", "勸佢睇醫生"]}
