{"phase": "e_ngai_first", "attempt": 0, "step": 3, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "ngai_wingnaam_base.webp", "name": "魏詠男", "line": "望夠未呀？後生仔，想睇打女飲酒，使唔使買飛入場呀？", "choices": []}
