{"phase": "e_ngai_first", "attempt": 0, "step": 8, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "ngai_wingnaam_smile.webp", "name": "魏詠男", "line": "你企喺度做咩啫？等我請你飲呀？我而家請唔起喇。", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_ngai_first", "attempt": 0, "step": 9, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "ngai_wingnaam_base.webp", "name": "阿偉", "line": "我唔飲酒㗎……我去士多買支汽水返嚟，好冇？", "choices": []}
{"phase": "e_ngai_first", "attempt": 0, "step": 10, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "ngai_wingnaam_base.webp", "name": "魏詠男", "line": "汽水？細路飲嗰啲呀……哈，你都幾得意。", "choices": []}
