{"phase": "e_ngai_T0sup", "attempt": 0, "step": 4, "kind": "enc", "L": "awi_base.webp", "R": "ngai_wingnaam_base.webp", "name": "", "line": "維港電影茶水檔邊，魏詠男壓低把聲，拉阿偉埋一邊。", "choices": []}
